WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:05.379
In this video you'll make a one-page keepsake of your Graduate Portrait.

2
00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:13.502
At the top of your portrait, select Print or save my keepsake. It's a copy of this page that fits on one sheet of paper.

3
00:00:14.002 --> 00:00:22.162
It shows your name, your class, and the school year, with every skill and the games and lessons that count. Your pinned words are on it too.

4
00:00:22.692 --> 00:00:31.282
Select Print or save as PDF. Fixer Nation doesn't keep a copy of this page, so save it somewhere safe, or print it now.

5
00:00:31.786 --> 00:00:42.176
A parent or guardian linked to your account can open the same keepsake from the parent portal. It shows the skills and activities, but not the words you pinned. Those stay yours.
